          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>At the command line, run the following command:

#  chown root:root &lt;audit log file&gt;

Replace &lt;audit log file&gt; with the log files not owned by root.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
