          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>When operating system accounts are disabled, user accessibility is affected. Accounts are used for identifying individual users or operating system processes. To detect and respond to events affecting user accessibility and system processing, operating systems must audit account disabling actions.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
