          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The Photon operating system must be configured so that all cron paths are protected from unauthorized modification.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
